{"t":"counsel","s":["H6098"],"a":[9]},{"t":" in this "},{"t":"city","s":["H5892"],"a":[11]},{"t":","}]},{"n":3,"text":"Who say, It is not the time to build houses; the city is the pot and we are the flesh.","tok":[{"t":"Who "},{"t":"say","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":", It is not the "},{"t":"time","s":["H7138"],"a":[2]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"build","s":["H1129"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"houses","s":["H1004"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; the city is the pot and we are the "},{"t":"flesh","s":["H1320"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"Therefore prophesy against them; prophesy, son of man.","tok":[{"t":"Therefore "},{"t":"prophesy","s":["H5012"],"a":[1]},{"t":" against them; "},{"t":"prophesy","s":["H5012"],"a":[3]},{"t":", "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"man","s":["H0120"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Then the Spirit of Jehovah fell upon me and said to me, Say, Thus says Jehovah, You speak in this way, O house of Israel, for I know the things that come up in your spirit.","tok":[{"t":"Then the "},{"t":"Spirit","s":["H7307"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"fell","s":["H5307"],"a":[0]},{"t":" upon me and "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[4]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"me","s":["H0559"],"a":[6]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Say","s":["H0559"],"a":[8]},{"t":", Thus says "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[9]},{"t":", You "},{"t":"speak","s":["H0559"],"a":[6]},{"t":" in this way, O "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[12]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[13]},{"t":", for I "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[17]},{"t":" the things that "},{"t":"come","s":["H4609"],"a":[14]},{"t":" up in your spirit."}]},{"n":6,"text":"You have multiplied your slain in this city, and you have filled its streets with the slain.","tok":[{"t":"You have "},{"t":"multiplied","s":["H7235"],"a":[0]},{"t":" your "},{"t":"slain","s":["H2491"],"a":[1]},{"t":" in this "},{"t":"city","s":["H5892"],"a":[2]},{"t":", and you have "},{"t":"filled","s":["